OL,3,GNEWSAThree children abducted by father
OL,4,Ain Inverness to return to mother after
OL,5,Acase spanning 10 countries
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree children who were abducted by
OL,8,Ftheir father in Inverness and taken to
OL,9,F10 different countries are to be
OL,10,Freturned to their mother in Scotland
OL,11,Fafter a decision by a court in Malta.
OL,13,FThe Ukrainian children had been living
OL,14,Fwith their parents at the Mercure Hotel
OL,15,Fin Inverness since July 2022 after
OL,16,Ffeeling their home country following
OL,17,Fthe Russian invasion.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
