OL,3,GNEWSAThree children abducted by father
OL,4,Ain Inverness to return to mother after
OL,5,Acase spanning 10 countries
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn October 2023, the three children
OL,8,Fleft the hotel in a car with their
OL,9,Ffather without the knowledge or consent
OL,10,Fof their mother and travelled to 10
OL,11,Fcountries over a period of three years.
OL,13,FThe father denied abducting the
OL,14,Fchildren but the court ordered the
OL,15,Fchildren - aged 15, 13 and 11 - should
OL,16,Fbe returned to their mother in
OL,17,FScotland.
